{"id":"n49862-1-7","stage":4,"title":"들락날락하다 · 进进出出","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49862-1-7-1","ko":"저 집에 왜 저렇게 사람들이 들락날락하지?","zh":"那家里怎么有那么多人进进出出的啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"저렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"저렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"저렇다","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71226","senseId":"1","lemma":"저렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저렇게","audio":"/audio/3e51b4147d3689f85089.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들이","audio":"/audio/42e5b243df0b3ed051af.mp3"}},{"text":"들락날락하지?","meaning":"进进出出","explanation":"들락날락하다：进进出出；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"들락날락하다","audio":"/audio/5c22d03d27f69df9f8de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49862","senseId":"1",