宴会，喜宴；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"잔치","audio":"/audio/e8a89a5a9e100e5f86cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69897","senseId":"1","lemma":"잔치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잔치를","audio":"/audio/08332a6d332f08b20420.mp3"}},{"text":"하나","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}},{"text":"보더라.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보더라","audio":"/audio/6ee96a464429cdeb6bf9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"重，重大，严重","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"某事的规模、范围、程度、力量等都超过了一般水平。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"e8a89a5a9e100e5f","term":"잔치","zh":"宴会，喜宴","audio":"/audio/e8a89a5a9e100e5f86cd.mp3","entryId":"69897","definition":"有喜事时，摆上食物许多人聚在一起享用。","pronunciation":["잔치"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ea9983c22c44a155656d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.535,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49862","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creati